@startuml domain-assistance
' Report §2.4 — Attendee assistance context. The domain classes come from
' include/domain-assistance.iuml, the same source the overview (domain-model.puml) uses.
' The agent types below are application-layer classes, drawn here because they are
' how this context uses its domain.
!pragma layout smetana
!include include/style.iuml
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

title Attendee assistance context (concierge-service) — domain model and Agenda Builder agent

!include include/domain-assistance.iuml

package "application.agent  (not domain: the LangChain4j agent around it)" as agent_pkg {
  interface AgendaBuilder <<Agent>> {
    @SystemMessage / @UserMessage
    --
    + buildAgenda(attendeeId, interests) : ProposedAgenda
  }
  class AgendaTools <<Agent>> {
    - dossier : Map<String, SessionSummary>
    --
    + @Tool searchSessions(track, day, speaker, keyword) : List<SessionSummary>
    + @Tool getSessionAvailability(sessionId) : AvailabilityAnswer
    + @Tool getAttendeeRegistrations(attendeeId) : List<RegistrationSummary>
    + @Tool detectTimeClashes(List<String> sessionIds) : List<Clash>
  }
  class ProposedAgenda <<record>> {
    items : List<ProposedItem(sessionId, rationale)>
    summary : String
  }
  class AgendaResult <<record>> {
    attendeeId : String
    summary : String
    items : List<AgendaItem>
    notes : List<String>
  }
}

AgendaBuilder ..> AgendaTools : may call (tool use)
AgendaBuilder ..> ProposedAgenda : structured output
AgendaTools "1" o-- "0..*" SessionSummary : dossier\n(retrieved this request)
AgendaTools ..> AvailabilitySummary : via RegistrationPort
AgendaTools ..> RegistrationSummary : via RegistrationPort
AgendaTools ..> ClashDetector : detectTimeClashes
AgendaResult ..> SessionSummary : verified items only

note bottom of ClashDetector
  The clash-free guarantee is code, not prompt:
  AgendaApplicationService re-runs firstConflict(...)
  over the model's answer and drops any session that
  overlaps one already accepted, or that the agent
  never retrieved, or that repeats.
end note

legend right
  Nothing in this context is persisted: every domain
  class is an immutable record (or stateless service)
  built from other services' REST responses.
  This context publishes and consumes no events.
endlegend
@enduml
